{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "story_broca_set_2_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_broca_set_2",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "憤怒的布洛卡",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕間",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_broca_2_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "a7ffcbae5a5871ff3bb6ca10e4d14327e273a5775b62b7e39c51eb86c02f81ba",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……奧斯塔，最近有什麼好玩的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哦，不對，奧斯塔出外勤了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，好無聊啊，就不能忽然發生點什麼有趣的事情嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，布洛卡，有沒有什麼想法？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……布洛卡，今天星期幾？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "星期二。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我吃完了，先回去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，布洛卡這幾天果然有問題啊，畢竟今天是星期三。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這傢伙肯定有事瞞著我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，剛才還想說很無聊，現在不就有事情做了嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "該去看看布洛卡在做什麼了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不對，直接去找他，他肯定不會告訴我，這種時候就應該——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，有了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "和大部分幹員的房間相比，布洛卡的房間並不算整潔。\n倒不是說他的房間有多雜亂，而是房間裡的東西實在不算少，地上、桌上甚至床上都擺著各種零件、圖紙和工具。\n與其說是宿舍，不如說是一個小型的工作室。\n而最顯眼的，是房間角落的那座工具台。\n來到羅德島後，他的手藝逐漸得到了認可，工程部也十分歡迎他的到來，並在工坊內為他準備了一塊區域，作為他的專屬工作區。\n然而，他卻拒絕了工坊的優渥條件，並表示希望在自己的房間裡工作。\n工程部同意了他的請求，為他專門購置了一座工具台之餘，還加強了房間的隔音效果。\n往常，回到房間的布洛卡會立刻開始製作工作。\n但今天，他卻並沒有這樣做，而是坐在椅子上，環視了一圈桌子周圍。\n桌子周圍貼滿了設計圖，而圖紙上畫的都是他的那把多功能電鑽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "感覺，這些設計都有點無法割捨啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，不過，今天又有一些新想法，再設計幾個版本看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好，開工——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "通訊提示音",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹員布洛卡，工程部傳來通知，請你立刻前往工程部一趟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "工程部……？難道是我之前問的材料有下文了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去看一眼吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，果然把他騙走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這種時候，要是奧斯塔在，肯定要感慨，布洛卡還是這麼單純。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要我說，就讓這傢伙永遠單純下去也沒有什麼不好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，趁他還沒回來，讓我來看看，布洛卡到底瞞著我在幹嘛吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？這些設計圖是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這個可以伸縮的鑽頭還蠻特別的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不過——我覺得還是這個比較好，內置音響，可以放點重金屬。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*敘拉古讚美詞*，這個不錯！可以從電鑽形態變成電鋸形態！這不是我們之前一起打的那個遊戲裡的武器嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我就知道……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你回來啦，布洛卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別看了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這些設計圖不是蠻好的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很有創意啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還以為你這幾天把自己關在房間裡，是不是背著兄弟在做什麼見不得人的事呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也沒有特意想瞞著你，只是最近有了很多新的改造想法……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這把電鑽一路跟著我從敘拉古來到這裡，它就跟我的另一條手臂一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我現在想把它改造一下，就這麼簡單。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這有什麼不能跟我說的？難道說，兄弟就不是你的手臂？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你上廁所時需要兄弟幫忙扶著嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你叫我的話，我肯定可以啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說真的，我還真想過，等我們以後年紀大了，就互相——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*很難聽的敘拉古俚語*。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "關鍵是，這些都是我自己亂改的東西！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我從一開始就沒打算給別人看！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這也沒什麼關係吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道我們不是無話不談的兄弟嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無話不談和這個是兩碼事！我想給你看的時候，會給你看的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈！那我現在也已經看到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，反正我已經看到了，乾脆我也來一起幫忙改造你的電鑽吧！奧斯塔沒回來，我也閒著沒事做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor_4"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布洛卡，開門啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這傢伙怎麼生氣了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也搞不懂，只是改造一個電鑽而已，有必要這樣偷偷摸摸的嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，你不讓我一起，我偏要唱反調。等著吧，布洛卡！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "繼續吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "…………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "………………"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡啊，都怪賈維這個混蛋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "害我現在根本靜不下心來做新的設計！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "倒不如說，已經完全沒心思了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，出去散散心，找找靈感吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesgreenhouse"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "每當布洛卡感覺心神不寧的時候，他就會來調香師打理的療養庭院坐一下。\n一踏入庭院，沁人心脾的香氣撲面而來。\n他找了一個角落坐下，然後，開始盡情地呼吸甜美的空氣。\n幾個深呼吸後，他感覺自己的心情平靜了不少。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，如果電鑽在轉動的時候——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我說，要不然，我們幫電鑽加上能夠釋放香氛的功能吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "幹嘛？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼又來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看到你往這邊走，就跟過來了呀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "比起這個，我們剛才想得是一樣的，對吧？兄弟！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，沒有。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？你剛才絕對提到了電鑽吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽錯了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不可能，而且我們是兄弟耶，我太瞭解你了，這種時候，我們想到的東西絕對是一樣的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就算它剛才是，現在它也不是了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為我們想的一樣，而且，它被你搶先說出來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什麼？兄弟，我們一起改造了這麼多的東西，我怎麼不知道，你還有這種潔癖？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這不一樣，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "這是我自己決定要改造的東西，所以，這不一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，那你就講清楚，到底有什麼地方不一樣啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "49_g14_rhodesdeck_d"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "甲板上的風很大，雖然能隱約看到遠處有幾個幹員，但大致上，可以用“沒人”來概括這裡的情況。\n和部分幹員一樣，布洛卡喜歡挑這種時候來到這裡。\n僅僅只是為了享受這種空曠的孤獨感。\n當然，今天的他還有一個目的。\n他換了十幾條通道，特意走錯了八道閘門，分別在六個活動室逗留了一陣子，最終才來到這裡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……但願賈維那傢伙不會找過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "布洛卡來到欄杆旁，感受強風刮過自己髮梢的撕扯感，放空了自己的大腦。\n他決定什麼都不再去想，就在這裡發呆到吃晚飯的時候。\n到那個時候，賈維差不多也冷靜下來了。\n然而，事與願違。\n有隻手拍了拍他的肩膀。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "為什麼，賈維。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "在他身後，賈維站在那裡，手中拿著幾張設計圖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟，我想了想，確實，既然你已經做了那麼多設計，我也該拿出我的設計才對。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我剛才去畫了幾張，你要不要看一下？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，兄弟，你還不懂，我需要的不是這個。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那你需要的到底是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我什麼都不要，我就是想一個人改造一下這把電鑽，要是有時間的話，順便實現一些創意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "對啊，所以我不懂的就是——為什麼你一定要一個人搞這個呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為——嘖，我該怎麼跟你說呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你怎麼想就怎麼說，我又不可能會嘲笑你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是這個問題，兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有些想法我就是說不出口。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你不說的話，我不知道啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是你是我兄弟，我絕對現在就把你丟下甲板。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好吧……因為我覺得這些創意本身都沒有什麼了不起的，就跟小時候隨便塗塗畫畫一樣。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它們沒必要讓別人知道，我一個人隨便玩玩就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "結果，現在你知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "搞了半天，原來是這樣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道，你一直對自己沒自信，所以，會有這種想法也不奇怪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是我覺得，你來到羅德島也很久了，你的手藝大家都看在眼裡，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，你也要對自己有信心才行啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……也不完全是這樣。不過，你這傢伙難得說點人話，還是謝謝你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我還沒說完呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，我覺得你那些創意都很有趣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我決定了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去把你那些創意拿給工程部的人看看，要是他們都認可你了，你就不會這麼自卑了吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……等，不是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賈維，你給我站住，我要殺了你！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_room_2"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，來晚了一步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工具台上，原本貼在那裡的幾張設計圖已經不翼而飛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可惡，我明天就去申請換門鎖，不能再把我房間的備用門卡給賈維了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他會去哪裡——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶，對了，一時氣昏了，工程部，對，工程部。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_corridor"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——這次外勤終於結束了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "總算可以放鬆一下——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，你回來了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛幹員",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賈維好像有什麼東西要在工程部發表，正在找人去看呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "火神大姐。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "火神",
      "speakerId": "avg_163_hpsts_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，你這個小子一出現，絕對沒好事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，我這次可是帶來了許多有趣的設計哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看這些設計——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "太好了，趕上了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖，布洛卡，你這個傢伙也太害羞了吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "根本不是你想的那樣——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘖嘖，別裝了，我已經完全理解你的想法了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*敘拉古俚語*，你能理解就見鬼了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，今天我一定要讓大家看看你的設計。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想都別想！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，發生什麼事情了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維&布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，你回來了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我聽說賈維要發表什麼東西，就想說過來看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼感覺你們兩個快打起來了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維&布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你聽我說，布洛卡/賈維這傢伙他——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好了，我已經知道事情經過了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，你說，是誰有道理？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布洛卡，你先說，你打算怎麼辦吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "賈維。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我已經想好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想了結這件事，我必須把你打趴下，讓你在床上躺個三天左右才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，膽子變大了啊，布洛卡。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不是我膽子變大了，是你逼我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你知道自己在說什麼，對吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是認真的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……哈，好！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_canteen"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊啊啊，氣死我了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，我最近應該沒有做什麼讓布洛卡不爽的事吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "沒有吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他是不是不想跟我們當兄弟了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你想多了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，羅德島上確實有很多有趣的傢伙，要是他有單飛的想法，我應該祝福他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "都說了不是這麼一回事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們一路從敘拉古走到今天，我不允許我們的團隊就這樣解散。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "無論他有什麼想法，他都必須先戰勝我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而我——絕對會拿出我的全力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，你說對吧？你幹嘛用這種眼神看我？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是在想，這麼多年過去了，你和布洛卡真是一點都沒變。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。對了，賈維。今天中午有你最愛的千層麵，你不多吃點嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我再去幫你多裝幾杯飲料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，好！吃飽喝飽了才有力氣修理布洛卡那個傢伙！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布洛卡，吃飽了嗎？今天我不會手下留情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我也不會放水的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你現在後悔還來得及。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，賈維，這一架我非打不可。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因為不這樣的話，你永遠都不會放棄幫我，不是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "廢話，你和奧斯塔是我最好的兄弟，我當然不能放著你們不管。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？你已經不需要我的幫助了嗎？你不需要兄弟了，是嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……我當然也把你和奧斯塔當成最好的兄弟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果你還把我和奧斯塔當作兄弟，那就應該找我們兩個一起解決問題！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "遠處的奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "別把我算進去……算了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是這跟是不是兄弟完全沒有關係！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我們是兄弟，跟我想自己解決問題沒有矛盾！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你這個傢伙，真是頑固！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "頑固的是你，賈維！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看來我只能用我的拳頭和扳手讓你想起來，我們賈維團隊的三兄弟是密不可分的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我也只能用我的拳頭和鑽頭告訴你，最好的兄弟也是需要有一點自己的空間的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我才不需要那種東西，你這個混帳——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我需要啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎麼回事，我的肚子——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘶……我的肚子，好痛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，你陷害我——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……抱歉，賈維。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_trainingcom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，賈維還在生氣嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你都這麼說了，他當然會生氣吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他還問我，自己最近是不是哪裡得罪你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我知道他是真心想幫我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他就是這樣的人，把自己的一切都毫無保留地展現給身邊的人，永遠不會理解，有的人是需要一點私人空間的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他會聽你的解釋，他就不叫賈維了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "說的也是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "布洛卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_356_broca_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我想請你幫我一個忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_rhodesengineeringroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "工程部的一角，賈維虛弱地躺在長椅上，摀著肚子看著天花板，讓人感覺他正經歷著前所未有的迷茫。\n奧斯塔則拿著一個袋子坐在他的旁邊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "布洛卡去醫療部幫你開了點胃藥，吃下這個，明天應該就能好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "奧斯塔，我還是不懂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "難道說，就算是最好的兄弟，彼此也不能做到毫無保留嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "兄弟、情侶、家族，有太多存在於這些關係中的秘密了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的時候，連我們自己都無法做到對自己毫無保留。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "放眼這片大地，恐怕也只有你會問這種問題了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你也有事瞞著我嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "賈維",
      "speakerId": "avg_349_chiave_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我該怎麼辦？難道我必須接受這件事嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "遠處，布洛卡站在工程部某個工坊的門口，他已經準備就緒。\n但他還是擔憂地望向了奧斯塔和賈維這邊，奧斯塔對他點了點頭，示意他放心。\n布洛卡鬆了口氣，終於下定決心，帶著已經準備好的材料和自己的電鑽走進工坊之中。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或許，有的時候，我們只需要等待。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "奧斯塔",
      "speakerId": "avg_346_aosta_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "然後，用笑容去迎接我們最好的兄弟凱旋。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
